    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Link Star adds a powerful link block to your WordPress editor with advanced styling options and hover effects. Perfect for creating call-to-action buttons and styled navigation elements.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong><br />\n* Advanced styling controls<br />\n* Customizable hover effects<br />\n* Icon support<br />\n* SEO-friendly options (nofollow, new tab)<br />\n* Full Site Editing compatible</p>\n<p><strong>Development &amp; Source Code:</strong><br />\nLinkStar is open-source and developed publicly on GitHub.</p>\n<p>GitHub repository: https://github.com/Engramium/linkstar</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Install through WordPress admin or upload to <code>/wp-content/plugins/linkstar</code></li>\n<li>Activate the plugin</li>\n<li>Find &#8220;Link Star&#8221; in the Widgets block category</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"is%20it%20compatible%20with%20my%20theme%3F\">\nIs it compatible with my theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, Link Star works with any properly coded WordPress theme.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20work%20with%20full%20site%20editing%3F\">\nDoes it work with Full Site Editing?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, fully compatible with FSE themes and modern WordPress features.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Create customizable link blocks with hover effects and advanced styling options.",
    "description": "<p>Link Star adds a powerful link block to your WordPress editor with advanced styling options and hover effects. Perfect for creating call-to-action buttons and styled navigation elements.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong><br />\n* Advanced styling controls<br />\n* Customizable hover effects<br />\n* Icon support<br />\n* SEO-friendly options (nofollow, new tab)<br />\n* Full Site Editing compatible</p>\n<p><strong>Development &amp; Source Code:</strong><br />\nLinkStar is open-source and developed publicly on GitHub.</p>\n<p>GitHub repository: https://github.com/Engramium/linkstar</p>\n",
